From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:59:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] windows.web/tests: test Windows.Web.Http against a server in
 the process.

The order the header collections list headers in, Location and Host
kept as a Uri and a HostName, how a body reads as text by its
Content-Type, the buffer a content hands out, and what HttpClient sends:
cookies a response set, the order of the headers on the wire, HEAD with
no length, and a POST a 303 turned into a GET.  Every expectation was
checked on Windows first.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit a0a15c6aec5ec7b46736302f2d1ed4bef8c20e90)

